A||N||4||87ECO5||Are these symptoms of a cold start injector problem?||||5||
Z||000000||87ECO5||10-30-2001||10:06 AM||||Last few mornings, I've gone out around 6:30 in the morning to start my car.  After several attempts and no start, I'll press the accelerator pedal to the floor 6-8 times while cranking then leave the car.  About an hour later, I'll come back and the car will start immediately.<P>I originally thought it was fuel pump related but it seems to run fine (i.e. getting sufficient fuel) once it's started:<P> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum2/HTML/014559.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum2/HTML/014559.html</A> <P>Is this a cold start injector problem?<P>TIA||||reg||5
Z||000001||Voytek||10-30-2001||12:08 PM||||I'm not sure about the cold start injector but leaky fuel injectors will cause this problem also.  If they don't hold pressure, they will leak fuel into the cylinders and it will cause you to have to crank more than once (or in your case a few times).  I've had the leaky injectors problem once (perhaps not as severe) and, once started, the car ran just fine.<P>Perhaps someone else has an idea on the cold start injector.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/voyteks_sig2.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000002||watts||10-30-2001||12:25 PM||||Next time it does this, try not touching the gas.  Now go sniff your tail pipe.  Stinky rich gas smell?  Could be the above leaky injectors.<P>If you mash the gas to the floor while cranking the ECM will go into clear flood mode and take care of (sort of) that problem by shutting off the injectors until you release the gas.<P>Have you checked the usual stuff like fuel pressure, coil voltage, etc?<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000003||87ECO5||10-31-2001||09:04 AM||||Well, I was going to sniff the exhaust pipe this morning (bet my neighbors would have loved that!) but the stupid thing started on the first try!<P>Temperatures were warmer last night.    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/confused.gif">||||reg||8
Z||000004||BOILERMAKER||10-31-2001||09:11 AM||||Maybe it doesn't want you sniffing it's butt, so it just figured it would start and save the embarassment.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
